      <div class="rf-article-answer">
        <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
        <p>Google Ads can help roofing companies reach property owners already searching for roof repairs, replacements and commercial roofing services. The goal is not simply to generate clicks. It is to turn relevant local searches into qualified inquiries and booked estimates.</p>
      </div>

